+cargo fmt --all -- --check                          -> exit 0 (cargo fmt --all run after the last Rust edit; it reflowed the two new application tests)
+cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --locked -j 6 -- -D warnings
+                                                    -> exit 0, no warnings
